  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a spooky yet cozy sanctuary with the Jeminise Halloween Comforter Set. This 5-piece bedding set features a charming Ghost 1 design, perfect for adding a touch of festive fun to your sleeping space. Crafted for ultimate comfort and durability, it’s an ideal choice for a delightful night's sleep.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Material:</strong> Filled with finely brushed microfibers for exceptional softness, lightness, and breathability, ensuring a peaceful night's sleep.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Content Included:</strong> Comes complete with a comforter (68\" x 90\"), flat sheet (66\" x 92\"), fitted sheet (39\" x 80\" x 14\"), one pillowcase (20\" x 30\"), and one pillow sham (20\" x 30\"). Pillow inserts are not included.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Exquisite Design:</strong> Features stylish patterns like Pumpkin, Ghost, and Bats, adding a fashionable and cozy touch to your bedroom decor.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Enhanced Durability:</strong> The comforter's exquisite stitching prevents filling from shifting or clumping, maintaining comfort over time.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Fit:</strong> The deep-pocket fitted sheet includes an elastic band for a secure fit on mattresses up to 14 inches thick.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Simply machine wash in cold water and tumble dry on low; designed to withstand years of use without weakening or tearing.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>All Seasons Use:</strong> Suitable for all seasons, including Fall, Summer, and Winter, providing comfort year-round.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Brushed Microfiber and Polyester Filling</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Ghost 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Pumpkin,Ghost,Bats</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Horror Cartoon</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 x Comforter &amp; 1 x Pillowcase &amp; 1 x Pillow Sham &amp; 1 x Fitted Sheet &amp; 1 x Flat Sheet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Twin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>90 x 68 x 1 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fitted Sheet Depth</th>\n<td>14 inches</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All, Fall, Summer, Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Number of Pieces</th>\n<td>5</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
